  "accuracy_notes": "This is a procedural interpretation of a private design; no visual-similarity percentage has been measured. The accepted middle yellow-green palette is retained, while fruit and face contours remain more regular than the reference. Cheer raises compact fists to the lower-cheek area; the preserved short arms do not reach over the oversized head. Wave loop velocity continuity has not been proven, so runtimes should blend into and out of Wave. The six expression figures in the kit remain static alternatives. Existing fitted overlaps and neck shading remain. The outlines are inverted hulls and require backface culling; disable their shadow casting in consuming renderers. No owner art approval is claimed.",
